Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 27/63] rule-set: the format text

A rule-set may be a plain text list of domains and IP CIDRs (format text), remote or local; its
names are built in place into a domain set, its addresses into a cidrset.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  01f958ab5 rule-set: format text, a list of domains and IP CIDRs as plain text
  1c91f79a9 rule-set: a local list in the format text is read; due rule-sets download five at a time
  c4958ce9f route/rule: a benchmark of what a rule set of 100000 names written as text costs to load
  26937d763 ruletext: domains of a text list built in place by common/domainset
  e358865ef ruletext: room for the names of a list made once, a name a line at most
  64c70134e ruletext: text lists carry their trie as DomainSet
  ae1c07f7b ruletext: addresses of a text list as a cidrset.Set

Pdk-Feature: ruletext
Pdk-Zone: core
Pdk-Layer: 03
